    rdfs:label "SP0 Foundation floor — the BEDROCK four-pillar taiji (structural Set theory / the full magma->abelian-group algebra tower + two-operation line + quasigroup/loop + module/vector, every rung a (Sigma,E) presented algebra minted through the LIFTED free-|forgetful engine / Site-sheaf-𝔗_f + SYN point-set spaces / functionality-typing = Curry's F = the Frame arrow, B/C/W/K/I + F_n + Gamma + variance bifunctor + the implication taiji) plus a logic sub-floor (P/N/⊃ + proof terms); SP1/SP2/SP3 re-anchor ADDITIVELY onto it (Directive 18/19/20)" ;
